<title>USA: Gibson Greetings CFO leaving in September.</title>
<headline>Gibson Greetings CFO leaving in September.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gibson Greetings Inc said Friday that Chief Financial Officer William Flaherty will leave the company in mid-September to accept another position.</p>
<p>Gibson President Frank O'Connell said Flaherty's departure is &quot;totally amicable.&quot;</p>
<p>O'Connell said the search for Flaherty's successor will begin immediately.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
